      "writtenOn": "2022-09-05T14:45:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What have you tried?\n\nThe normal way to achieve that would be to add a new prop to the Droidstubs struct, like this:\n\n    Extensions_info_file *string `android:\"path\"`\n    \nYou can then set that in Android.bp like this:\n\n    droidstubs {\n        ....\n        extension_info_file: \"filter.txt\",\n    }\n\nIf the filter.txt file is a in different dir than the droidstubs module itself (like in this case), you need a filegroup in the sdkext repo:\n\n    filegroup {\n        name: \"sdk-extensions-info\",\n        srcs: [\"filter.txt\"],\n    }\n\nAnd you refer to it like this (note the colon!):\n\n    droidstubs {\n        ....\n        extension_info_file: \":sdk-extensions-info\",\n    }",
      "parentUuid": "788a1eaa_387b05f2",
